3 Search every corner of Rainbow Gate: abandoned attractions, staff-only zones, and secret archives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Dynamic sound design, haunting visuals, and a chilling original soundtrack build an environment where fear never lets go.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dare to step inside, knowing the laughter of the Animatronics may be the last sound you ever hear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["7EVIL Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450780/13ffc3cf4b22d547d4d6d49d45d62fcf5ddb7519/header.jpg?t=1770129840","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2450780/1972679325/9cf6700cd261018b46921aa7b7568241a16ff906/1759306446/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759308312","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2450780/1972679325/9cf6700cd261018b46921aa7b7568241a16ff906/1759306446/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759308312","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2450780/1972679325/9cf6700cd261018b46921aa7b7568241a16ff906/1759306446/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759308312","id":257209898,"name":"Rainbow Gate Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209898/4b71f260e72fce975b93ba980820977a9099a691/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759308312"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2450780/1164707720/ba401dbdd8cbe7ae4b0cf8f21d051932231ce6ef